  "description": "Al Noor by Arabiyat Prestige is a luxurious oriental-amber fragrance that radiates warmth and sophistication. It opens with bright bergamot, saffron, and pink pepper , giving a vibrant and spicy introduction. The heart reveals a rich blend of rose, patchouli, and amber , creating depth and an elegant floral warmth. The base settles into musk, vanilla, oud, and tonka bean , forming a smooth, creamy, and long-lasting finish. Al Noor is the perfect balance of floral richness, soft sweetness, and smoky depth — an ideal scent for those who love refined, long-lasting perfumes with Arabian character.",
